   "ADM232A: no shutdown or enable. ADM222: active-low SHDN that disables drivers and receivers. ADM242: active-low SHDN that disables the drivers only, plus active-low EN for the receiver outputs.",
   "The ADM232A replaces the AD232 and ADM232L pin for pin; the three parts are pin compatible with MAX222, MAX232A and MAX242."
